{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>THE WAR.</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/05688217ed4d97af81dd15c3f5c41167.poster.avif?t=1773281874\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/05688217ed4d97af81dd15c3f5c41167.webm?t=1773281874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/05688217ed4d97af81dd15c3f5c41167.mp4?t=1773281874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Billions dead. The Alien Myriad has invaded and taken billions of lives. Every country is failing and the whole world is now counting you, the last resort, human's last bastion, the Assassin.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You have everything you need, guns and indefinite ammo:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/3943f71ea2d0edf4dfacc469490ab3fc.poster.avif?t=1773281874\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/3943f71ea2d0edf4dfacc469490ab3fc.webm?t=1773281874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/3943f71ea2d0edf4dfacc469490ab3fc.mp4?t=1773281874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some of the world's <strong>strongest</strong> weapons made by the best of the best lie in your arms.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's theirs is yours:</strong><